{
  "declaredLength": 1160,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "讓您安心的美味、氣氛與價位。\n歡迎來到譜通餐館。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9360A85B895FC376847F8E547330016C236C1B820750F94F4D3002000A6B618FCE4F8652308B5C901A9910992830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不斷以更高的境界為目標！\n這就是刻在我靈魂裡的生存風格。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D65B74EE566F49AD876845883754C70BA76EE6A19FF01000A90195C31662F523B5728621197489B4288E17684751F5B5898A8683C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請務必挑戰全餐。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB52D95FC56311623051689910300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會誇獎自己的人\n就只有自己呢～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67038A87734E81EA5DF176844EBA000A5C3153EA670981EA5DF15462FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得妳的寶可夢\n也在誇獎妳。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F9759B376845BF653EF5922000A4E5F57288A87734E59B330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對唯一的甜點\n全舌貫注！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D552F4E007684751C9EDE000A5168820C8CAB6CE8FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟這裡的橙香可麗餅\n很普通但可是最棒的呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF901988E176846A59999953EF9E979905000A5F88666E901A4F4653EF662F670068D27684546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一邊看寶可夢對戰\n一邊吃飯真的讚。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00908A770B5BF653EF59225C0D6230000A4E00908A540398EF771F76848B9A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看了不痛快的對戰\n飯也會變得不好吃喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4E864E0D75DB5FEB76845C0D6230000A98EF4E5F67038B8A5F974E0D597D5403559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢對戰一旦開始，\n孩子們就都不吃飯了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59225C0D62304E0065E6958B59CBFF0C000A5B695B5050115C3190FD4E0D540398EF4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人家會想把文柚果\n送給輸掉對戰的寶可夢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA5BB6670360F3628A658767DA679C000A90017D668F3863895C0D623076845BF653EF592230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我明白。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211660E767D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是沒辦法在這家店用餐，\n我可是會難過到哭出來的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F6C928FA66CD5572890195BB65E9775289910FF0C000A621153EF662F670396E3904E523054ED51FA4F86768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想安靜地\n享受用餐時光耶……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F35B89975C5730000A4EAB53D775289910664251498036202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是羅傑的料理！\n手藝越來越好了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F7F855091768465997406FF01000A624B85DD8D8A4F868D8A597D4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉，廚師的話\n我只知道志米一個人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49FF0C5EDA5E2B76848A71000A621153EA77E590535FD77C734E00500B4EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們慶祝結婚和銀婚時\n都是在這家店呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150116176795D7D505A5A548C92805A5A6642000A90FD662F572890195BB65E97546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這代表我們的生活\n一直以來都很安穩啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194EE38868621150117684751F6D3B000A4E0076F44EE54F8690FD5F885B897A69554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "套餐會提供前菜、湯品\n及魚類主菜。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59579910670363D04F9B524D83DC30016E6F54C1000A53CA9B5A985E4E3B83DC30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個人以前可是\n這家店的貴賓喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B4EBA4EE5524D53EF662F000A90195BB65E9776848CB48CD3559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "普通到極點後\n反而讓人感動……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "666E901A523069759EDE5F8C000A53CD800C8B934EBA611F52D5202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然能不斷地提供還算\n不錯的料理，實在是太棒了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713680FD4E0D65B7573063D04F9B90847B97000A4E0D932F768465997406FF0C5BE65728662F592A68D24E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想快點吃到！\n還是我乾脆跑進廚房好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F35FEB9EDE54035230FF01000A9084662F62114E7E81068DD190325EDA623F597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所謂的禮儀就是\n不讓別人有機可乘的武器喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408B02768479AE51005C31662F000A4E0D8B9352254EBA67096A5F53EF4E5876846B665668559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
  ],
